\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  If thou elevate thyself,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The Lord will have Thee humbled,
\par Be thyself humbled therefore,
\par And the Lord shall have thee raised.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  See how the Lord, thy master,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Left the glories of heaven,
\par God becomes human always,
\par Master turned into servant.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. He Himself became humbled,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And as well was submissive,
\par A feature of Godliness,
\par Until he was crucified.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. Therefore the Lord raised Him up,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He gave Him a great name then,
\par That all nations of the world,
\par Shall bow down and worship Him!
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  The way to the throne of Christ,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Passes through humility,
\par Before it does take us through,
\par To the glory of the Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  If  thyself  be arrogant,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 In want of worldly honour,
\par And so elevate thyself,
\par God shall surely block thy way.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7. In humility shall thou,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Clad thyself and so receive
\par The grace and kindness of God,
\par \pard       And be honoured forever.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

